✔ the one primary button follows what the workspace shows (3.4105ms)
✔ confirming the build makes the server hold the text first, then runs the three requests, and never sends the script itself (2.6458ms)
✔ a build stops before sending anything when the server could not take the text (4.4787ms)
✔ disposing a build between extraction and storyboard never sends the next mutation or navigates (0.8639ms)
